ional
> >> > >validation of what is in the TPM. The BIOS must provide a
> >> > >acpi_dev_resource_memory and a ACPI_SIG_TPM2 for the ACPI entry a=
t a
> >> > >minimum.
> >> >
> >> > Is it correct, that this is added in/for 4.11, so just recently? T=
esting
> >> > with Linux 4.10.8, everything is detected just fine.
> >>=20
> >> No, it is quite a bit older.. And it should only go for TPM2, which =
I
> >> don't think you have??
